{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1480.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"cbda5104d2c5901dd56fa4fe35f2a367ae88d50f8b2261141f6986d88fee2bd4","ja":"SNSとの付き合い方","zh":"玩转社交网络的方式","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1480.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"0cfd0e8189b702feda1d42bf7bd1629c8ee04ae8cc69ab580b9c21bb203d1d14","ja":"ファンの人の反響って、嬉しいよね。\nそれに応えたいって気持ち、すっごくわかるよ。","zh":"粉丝们的反响，真的很令人高兴呢。\n想要回应大家的那份心情，我非常能体会哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1480.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"7f50dcf5d05b51ecd1c6e454c20dc674fe7933d4a21830814e25616368d6a7b1","ja":"でも……SNSにあがってるリクエスト全部に\n無理して応えなくても、いいんじゃないかなぁ？","zh":"不过……社交媒体上发出来的要求，\n也不用勉强自己全部都回应吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1480.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"e02198cbb70f8ee93b4911410f14c4c05597aacf1862c1a60f5578c5e722722c","ja":"ええっ！？　そ、そうなんかい？","zh":"哎哎！？是、是这样吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1480.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"b6fe26e42bb63107ce076e18b7fc9eb690926133938c5dc3cebc403480fa2f07","ja":"アタシも翼に賛成！　だって、ファンが\nアタシたちに望むものって、人によって違うじゃん？","zh":"我也赞同翼的想法！毕竟粉丝希望\n我们展现出来的样子，每个人也都不一样吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1480.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"3a362aaea4e4025d30032804a2bc3766afa4be09f17af11399c96f01c01f0d8b","ja":"それ全部に応えるのって絶対無理だし、\n混乱するのも、あたりまえだと思うよ。","zh":"要回应所有的那些根本就不可能，\n会感到混乱也是理所当然的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1480.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"b6ba96451402f4fb4e7228b4214f348dbb23e52791748d14ea0254dc00820691","ja":"そうですね。ファンの期待に応えようとする姿勢は、\nとても素晴らしいと思いますが……。","zh":"是啊。想要回应粉丝期待的这份态度，\n我觉得固然非常了不起，但是……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1480.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"8d111deaf039a9b083d1fdd10e1025dc3e7c26bd646d3c4a842f0fd08f417d07","ja":"木下さんの負担になるなら、\n無理をしてまでやるべきではないかと。","zh":"如果会给木下同学造成负担，\n我觉得不应该勉强去做。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1480.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"0d38813625f424101a510852c792c5a9d7e8bd081675af2007c2ae7582b9f809","ja":"うんうん。それに、みんなだって、\nいつものひなたちゃんのほうが、見たいと思うよ～。","zh":"嗯嗯。而且，大家也肯定\n更想看到平时的日向呀～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1480.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"0d7d8f76f9db4845933659cddbb63e83961bd74a6a459371e31f575cc40b0bd2","ja":"そっかぁ。\nあたしは、いつものあたしのままでいいんだねぇ。","zh":"这样啊。\n只要做平时那个我就可以了吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1480.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"0f171c1675c8f301b5d36828e2acef5c0b879798eec3ef0e36b3a1cacf097576","ja":"SNSって、難しいよね。いろんな情報が入るけど、\nそれに振り回されないようにしないと。","zh":"SNS挺难应付的呢。虽然能接收到各种信息，\n但可不能被那些牵着鼻子走呀。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1480.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"cd97b6cbc1fe7fedd867925c2fb65b42877835fae3499b627f3c2546a865ec95","ja":"なるほど……あたしもSNSの扱いには、\nもっと気を付けていかねば！","zh":"原来如此……我也得更加注意\n如何使用社交媒体才行！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1480.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"0795ca1f077a78aa164c861e9144cc9e89f363cf06dbb25c8e0f524e907685a6","ja":"うんうん、答えが出たみたいで何よりだよ！\nこれからも、何か悩みがあったら遠慮なく相談してね！","zh":"嗯嗯，看来你已经找到答案了，真是太好了！\n以后要是还有什么烦恼，随时都可以来找我商量哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1480.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"979f9b39f82394579974b9ddb492f8be77ebe24d3293aee9a0882d4e52bfcba3","ja":"うん！　ありがとさん。\nみんな、これからも頼りにしてるねぇ！","zh":"嗯！多谢啦。\n大家，今后也多拜托你们喽！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
